<h1>Your <%= appName %> Download</h1>
<p class="muted">Thanks for your purchase!</p>

<div class="card">
  <h2><%= appName %> for Android</h2>
  <p><a class="btn" href="<%= downloadUrl %>">Download APK</a></p>
  <h3>Your update code</h3>
  <p><code><%= token %></code></p>
  <p>Enter it in the app when it asks, so future updates download automatically.</p>
  <h3>Install</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the downloaded APK file.</li>
    <li>Allow installs from this source if your phone asks.</li>
    <li>Tap Install.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="muted fineprint">Need help? Contact us anytime.</p>
</div>
